   "tag": "p",
   "text": "ARCHAEOLOGY CATALOGUE · ROW BA-116 literary parallel; Exodus identification unsupported"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "What it supports. Enmarch's scholarly commentary treats Ipuwer as an Egyptian literary dialogue about disorder, divine justice and responsibility."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "What it does not. Shared disaster imagery is not evidence that the papyrus reports the Exodus plagues. Composition, surviving-copy date and literary setting must be distinguished."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Bears on: Exodus 7-12"
  },
  {
